118 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (This report audits the technical health, backlink profile, organic search visibility, and traffic performance of www.zimra.co.zw, the official website of the Zimbabwe Revenue Authority \(ZIMRA\). The analysis draws on four Semrush reports pulled between July 30 and August 2, 2026 \(Site Audit, Backlink Audit, Position Tracking, and Traffic Analytics\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
119 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (ZIMRA is the government agency responsible for assessing, collecting, and accounting for tax and customs revenue on behalf of the Republic of Zimbabwe. Its website is not a marketing brochure ,it is critical public infrastructure. Taxpayers use it to register, file, and pay taxes through the MyTaxSelfService portal; importers use it to declare goods through eCustoms/eTIP, and businesses rely on it for fiscal device \(FDMS\) compliance. Because of this, downtime, broken functionality, or security gaps carry real consequences for citizens and the national revenue base; this is a substantially higher-stakes audit than a typical commercial website.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
